# .envrc (direnv)
#
# Ties local operations to one environment: `pnpm dev`, `pnpm build` and
# `pnpm edge:error-page` all read the same variables. Nothing sensitive lives
# here. Values go in .env (every variable is declared in .env.example) and
# personal overrides in .env.local; both are gitignored.
#
# Each dotenv call exports into the same shell, so later calls win. The
# resulting precedence is .env.local > .env > the parent directory's .envrc.

source_up_if_exists
dotenv_if_exists
dotenv_if_exists .env.local
